#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[ConstantSlope]"
msgstr "Constant Slope"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[ConstantSlope]"
msgstr "Forces newly placed networks to have a constant slope or grade from starting point to end point (A -> B)."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[Ground]"
msgstr "Ground"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[Ground]"
msgstr "Forces terrain to follow newly placed network. Zoned roads should produce zones under normal circumstances."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[WideMedian]"
msgstr "Wide Median"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[WideMedian]"
msgstr "Applies Wide Sidewalk upgrade to the median to produce a wide concrete median."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[ReplaceUpgrade]"
msgstr "Replace Upgrades"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[ReplaceUpgrade]"
msgstr "When toggled, replace tool mode will add or remove network upgrades to match the selected upgrades. If not toggled, replace tool mode will preserve network upgrades, if possible."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[AnarchyComponentsTool]"
msgstr "Anarchy Components Tool"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[AnarchyComponentsTool]"
msgstr "Add or remove transform lock or anarchy components using a tool with radius or single selection. Radius is recommended for Anarchy component since you can see overridden objects and interact with them. Single selection cannot select overriden objects and they are not visible."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[IncreaseRadius]"
msgstr "Increase the radius."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[DecreaseRadius]"
msgstr "Decrease the radius."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[SingleSelection]"
msgstr "Single Selection"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[SingleSelection]"
msgstr "Left Mouse Button to add selected component(s). Right Mouse Button to remove selected component(s). Single selection cannot select overriden objects and they are not visible."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[RadiusSelection]"
msgstr "Radius Selection"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[RadiusSelection]"
msgstr "Left Mouse Button to add selected component(s) within radius. Right Mouse Button to remove selected component(s) within radius. Radius is recommended for Anarchy component since you can see overridden objects and interact with them."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_TITLE[ExpandedElevationRange]"
msgstr "Expanded Elevation Range"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Anarchy.TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION[ExpandedElevationRange]"
msgstr "Expands the elevation range for networks to -1000 minimum and 1000 maximum."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.NAME[Quay01]"
msgstr "Quay"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Quay01]"
msgstr "Network raised above terrain with one or two walls along one or both sides. Can be applied to left or right side of applicable networks."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.NAME[RetainingWall01]"
msgstr "Retaining Wall"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[RetainingWall01]"
msgstr "Network lowered below terrain with one or two walls along one or both sides. Can be applied to left or right side of applicable networks."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.NAME[Elevated01]"
msgstr "Elevated"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Elevated01]"
msgstr "Forces a network to utilize the elevated mode (i.e. bridge, overpass, crossover)."

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.NAME[Tunnel01]"
msgstr "Tunnel"

#: Anarchy
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Tunnel01]"
msgstr "Forces a network to become a tunnel. Forced tunnel visuals are often undesirable. Use only, if necessary."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.SECTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod]"
msgstr "Better Bulldozer"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AllowRemovingSubElementNetworks]"
msgstr "Allow Removing Sub-Element Networks"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AllowRemovingSubElementNetworks]"
msgstr "Allow removing networks such as roads, paths, markers, etc from buildings. Removing Sub-Element networks may break connectivity within an asset."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AllowRemovingExtensions]"
msgstr "Allow Removing Extensions"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AllowRemovingExtensions]"
msgstr "Extensions are building upgrades that do are within the footprint of the main building lot. This will allow you to remove them, but removing some extensions may break connectivity within the asset."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalManicuredGrass]"
msgstr "Automatically Remove Manicured Grass"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalManicuredGrass]"
msgstr "Automatically removes Grass Surface 01 and Grass Surface 02 from buildings plopped and spawned."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalFencesAndHedges]"
msgstr "Automatically Remove Fences and Hedges"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalFencesAndHedges]"
msgstr "Automatically removes fences and hedges from buildings plopped, spawned, when they update, and when loading a save. They still appear temporarily while moving or plopping. This is intended for players that want to draw their own fencing everywhere and do not want to remove fencing everytime. Disabling this triggers a restoration which takes time to complete especially if you are automatically removing branding objects."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalBrandingObjects]"
msgstr "Automatically Remove Branding objects and Advertisements"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.AutomaticRemovalBrandingObjects]"
msgstr "Automatically removes branding objects and advertisements from buildings plopped, spawned, when they update, and when loading a save. They still appear temporarily while moving or plopping. This is intended for players that do not want any branding objects anywhere and may want control over when and where they apply branding objects. Disabling this triggers a restoration which takes time to complete especially if you are automatically removing fences and hedges."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.ResetModSettings]"
msgstr "Reset Better Bulldozer Settings"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.ResetModSettings]"
msgstr "After confirmation this will reset Better Bulldozer Settings."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.WARNING[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.ResetModSettings]"
msgstr "Reset Better Bulldozer  Settings?"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.SafelyRemove]"
msgstr "Safely Remove"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.SafelyRemove]"
msgstr "This is only recommended if you have used Matching and Similar selection modes of the Remove Sub-Elements tool mode to 'permanently remove' specific types or categories of sub-elements. This removes all history of what was 'permanently removed' by removing all Better Bulldozer mod components and storage entities from your save file. This cannot be undone."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.WARNING[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.SafelyRemove]"
msgstr "Safely Remove Better Bulldozer mod?"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreFencesAndHedges]"
msgstr "Restore Fences and Hedges"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreFencesAndHedges]"
msgstr "Triggers updates on all buildings and areas with sub-lanes so that fences and hedges (and all subobjects not 'permanently removed') get restored after having used Automatically Remove Fences and Hedges. This may take some time."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.WARNING[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreFencesAndHedges]"
msgstr "Restore Fences and Hedges? This may take some time especially if you are automatically removing branding objects."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreBrandingObjects]"
msgstr "Restore Branding Objects"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreBrandingObjects]"
msgstr "Triggers updates on everything with sub-objects so that all sub-objects including branding objects not 'permanently removed' get restored after having used Automatically Remove Branding objects and Advertisements. This may take some time."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.WARNING[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RestoreBrandingObjects]"
msgstr "Restore Branding Objects? This may take some time especially if you are automatically removing fences and hedges."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RemovedOwnedGrassSurfaces]"
msgstr "Remove Owned Grass Surfaces"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RemovedOwnedGrassSurfaces]"
msgstr "Removes all Grass Surface 01 and Grass Surface 02 from buildings that already exist. This cannot be undone."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.WARNING[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.RemovedOwnedGrassSurfaces]"
msgstr "Remove Grass Surfaces from all buildings? This cannot be undone."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.Version]"
msgstr "Version"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[BetterBulldozer.Better_Bulldozer.BetterBulldozerMod.BetterBulldozerModSettings.Version]"
msgstr "Version number for the Better Bulldozer mod installed."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.RaycastMarkersButton"
msgstr "Shows and EXCLUSIVELY targets static object markers or invisible networks. With this enabled you can demolish invisible networks, invisible parking decals, various spots, points, and spawners, but SAVE FIRST! Also use Remove Sub-Elements to remove from buildings."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.GameplayManipulationButton"
msgstr "Allows you to use the bulldozer on moving objects such as vehicles or cims."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.BypassConfirmationButton"
msgstr "Disables the prompt for whether you are sure you want to demolish a building."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.RaycastAreasButton"
msgstr "Makes the bulldozer EXCLUSIVELY target surfaces or spaces inside or outside of buildings so you can remove them in one click. You must turn this off to bulldoze anything else."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER.Filter"
msgstr "Filter"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.SurfacesFilterButton"
msgstr "For removing surfaces inside or outside of buildings in one click."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.SpacesFilterButton"
msgstr "For removing spaces including: Walking, Park, and Hangout areas. With this enabled you can target them inside or outside buildings and remove with one click."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.StaticObjectsFilterButton"
msgstr "For removing invisible parking decals, various spots, points, and spawners. Also use Remove Sub-Elements to remove from buildings. Without Remove Sub-Elements, trying to target those inside buildings will remove the building!"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.NetworksFilterButton"
msgstr "For removing invisible networks. Also use Remove Sub-Elements to remove from buildings, if it not disabled in settings. Without Remove Sub-Elements, trying to target those inside buildings will have no effect."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "YY_BETTER_BULLDOZER_DESCRIPTION.RaycastLanesButton"
msgstr "For removing Net-Lane and Net-Lane-Geometry prefabs such as interconnected fences, interconnected hedges, and linear street markings. You cannot create these in-game without a mod for it."

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "BetterBulldozer.TOOLTIP_TITLE[GameplayManipulationButton]"
msgstr "Remove Moving Objects and Cims"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "BetterBulldozer.TOOLTIP_TITLE[RaycastAreasButton]"
msgstr "Remove Surfaces and Spaces"

#: Better_Bulldozer
msgid "BetterBulldozer.TOOLTIP_TITLE[RaycastMarkersButton]"
msgstr "Remove Markers"

